# Premarket report — weekday 8:45 AM America/New_York
#
# crontab -e  (Linux / macOS)
# Replace REPO with your checkout path and PYTHON with your interpreter.
#
#   45 8 * * 1-5 cd REPO && TZ=America/New_York PYTHON scripts/premarket_report.py --strict-premarket --out REPO/logs/
#
# Or use the wrapper:
#   45 8 * * 1-5 REPO/scripts/run_premarket_report.sh
